// body.stout, three-quarter: the bare dwarf turned toward screen right. The
// near (right) arm is on screen left; idle breathes, act_worker readies,
// raises and strikes with the near hand, act_diplomat stands and bows.
canvas 64 64
anchor 32 64
frame idle 0
